# oracle: pair_style pod (Ta_param.pod + Ta_coeff.pod of examples/PACKAGES/pod/Ta) on a displaced bcc Ta 4x4x4 cell (128 atoms), run 0: energy, pressure, forces
# oracle-inputs: w128pod_Ta_param.pod w128pod_Ta_coeff.pod
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-8 abs=1e-10
# Measured with native LAMMPS (black box): max relative error of the engine against native over thermo (pe, press, etotal) 3.6e-12, over the per-atom forces scaled by max(1,|f|) 1.5e-13 (the tolerance is 1e-8).
units           metal
atom_style      atomic
boundary        p p p
variable        a equal 3.316
lattice         bcc $a
region          box block 0 4 0 4 0 4
create_box      1 box
create_atoms    1 box
mass            1 180.88
variable        dx atom 0.05*sin(1.3*x+0.7*y)
variable        dy atom 0.05*cos(0.9*y-0.4*z)
variable        dz atom 0.05*sin(1.1*z+0.5*x)
displace_atoms  all move v_dx v_dy v_dz units box
pair_style      pod
pair_coeff      * * w128pod_Ta_param.pod w128pod_Ta_coeff.pod Ta
thermo_style    custom step pe press etotal
thermo_modify   format float %.15g norm no
thermo          10
run             0
